[K<h1 align="center">KDOS</h1>
[K
[K<p align="center"><b><i>I use KDOS btw.</i></b></p>
[K
[K<p align="center">
[KA Linux distribution compiled from source, one <code>kpkgbuild</code> at a time 
[K—<br>
[Kwith a desktop that is a character grid all the way down.
[K</p>
[K
[K<p align="center">
[K<b>musl</b> · <b>toybox</b> · <b>wlroots</b> · <b>no systemd</b> · <b>no Xor
[Kg</b> · <b>no GTK or Qt on the host</b>
[K</p>
[K
[K<p align="center">
[K<sub>764 ports · Linux 7.0.10 · 758 packages · 181 containerised applications
[K · builds offline from this repo</sub>
[K</p>
