[K## What KDOS is
[K
[KFour properties. Everything else in this repository follows from them, and each
[Kis covered in [Why KDOS](docs/kdos/01-philosophy/why-kdos.md).
[K
[K**Built from source, with named exceptions.** The host is compiled here from
[Kupstream tarballs by 764 recipes: cross toolchain → musl userland →
